{"id":"u-c7d65b2f-bc6a-4768-b23b-2ed182ddf5c5","src":"community","title":"ABC Split","author":"Matthew H.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/m8lfqS-abc-split","desc":"Do 2-3 warm up sets prior to the 1 all out working set. Push yourself! Focus mainly on slow, controlled reps. NOT just purely moving heavy weight for target rep range. Aim for a 4-1-4 cadence. 4sec up/down, 1sec pause at top/bottom, 4 sec up/down. \n\nRep ranges are arbitrary. Try to find a weight that will be adequate to hit failure in those ranges. If you find the weight is too light or heavy, don't sweat it. Just hit failure with that slow tempo then alter it next time. \n\n1-3 days rest between days depending on your recovery ability. LISTEN TO YOUR BODY! Sleep and eat adequately and you'll see gains like crazy!\n\nLET'S GET AFTER IT!","level":["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:24:30.328Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest/Front/Side Delts/Tris","Back/Rear Delt/Traps/Biceps","Legs & Abs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Close Grip)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Underhand Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Shrug (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Squat